sequenceDiagram
    %% Persisted suggestion acceptance flow
    actor Admin
    participant UI as SuggestionReviewPanel
    participant Hooks as useMutation (React Query)
    participant WPAPI as WP REST /recognition/suggestions
    participant RecSvc as Recognition Service
    participant DB as identity_suggestions + clusters

    Admin->>UI: Click "Accept" on suggestion card
    UI->>Hooks: acceptSuggestion(suggestion_id)
    Hooks->>WPAPI: POST /recognition/suggestions/{id}/accept
    WPAPI->>RecSvc: /recognition/suggestions/{id}/accept
    RecSvc->>DB: set resolution='accepted'; resolved_at=now
    RecSvc->>RecSvc: assign_identity_to_cluster()
    RecSvc-->>WPAPI: SuggestionResponse
    WPAPI-->>Hooks: status=accepted
    Hooks->>Hooks: invalidate queries ['recognition-clusters','recognition-suggestions','identity-suggestions']
    Hooks-->>UI: update list + toast
    UI-->>Admin: Show updated badge + cluster counts
